[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558111707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100691#issuecomment-2558111707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100691","id":2558111707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yea_b","user":{"login":"zaevi","id":12966814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTY2ODE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12966814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi","html_url":"https://github.com/zaevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T12:48:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-01T20:52:18Z","body":"More simplified reproduction:\n\n```C#\npublic override void _Process(double delta)\n{\n\tvar tree = GetTree();\n\tfor (var i = 0; i < 1000; i++)\n\t{\n\t\tusing var timer = tree.CreateTimer(0.1f);\n\t\ttimer.Timeout += () => { };\n\t}\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558111707/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558115695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100691#issuecomment-2558115695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100691","id":2558115695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yeb9v","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T12:59:49Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T13:05:35Z","body":"This may boil down to a Callable behavior issue on disposed nodes.\n\n1. Should connected C# Callables stop working after disposing the node?\n2. Should non-C# related Callables stop working after disposing of the node, only because they are connected in C#?\n\nAnyway, if things stop working after disposing the node, we should have a more intuitive error message to warn the user.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558115695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558154854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100691#issuecomment-2558154854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100691","id":2558154854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yelhm","user":{"login":"zaevi","id":12966814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTY2ODE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12966814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi","html_url":"https://github.com/zaevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T15:40:49Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T15:40:49Z","body":"I narrowed down the troubleshooting to disposing `RefCounted`.\n\nIt seems that when disposing `RefCounted` that holds more than 1 ref-count, it doesn't untie the instance binding correctly:\n\n```C#\npublic override void _Ready()\n{\n\tvar rc = new RefCounted();\n\trc.Reference();\n\n\tvar id = rc.GetInstanceId();\n\trc.Dispose();\n\n\tvar rc2 = InstanceFromId(id) as RefCounted;\n\n\t// rc2.GetReferenceCount(); // ObjectDisposedException\n\tDebug.Assert(ReferenceEquals(rc, rc2) == false); // Fail\n}\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558154854/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/commen